      "id": "t_fec",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "FEC: <root=10.0.0.1, opaque=0x100>\nEach leaf sends Label Mapping\nupstream via mLDP extensions.\nMid P replicates one packet\ninto N egress labels.\n\nNo PIM in core -- pure MPLS.",
